      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Each extraction locks the maximum of the active heap at the end, then restores the heap in O(log n) time.\nTotal sorting phase time: (n - 1) * O(log n) = O(n log n). In-place and non-stable.",
      "originalText": "Each extraction locks the maximum of the active heap at the end, then restores the heap in O(log n) time.\nTotal sorting phase time: (n - 1) * O(log n) = O(n log n). In-place and non-stable.",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "ch5-10-heap-sort-flow-n81",
